<Base title="Play"><header class="page-head"><p class="eyebrow">The playable room</p><h1>Play</h1><p class="lead">The current game runs locally on its development machine. A public browser build is being prepared; this page will link to it when it has been audited and tested.</p></header><section class="section split"><div><h2>What’s in the room</h2><p>Move, aim, fire a two-shell shotgun, break targets and wall tiles, reload, and press Q to explore from the raccoon’s perspective. Pixel resolution, vertex snapping, dithering, and fog are part of the ongoing visual experiment.</p></div><div><h2>Controls</h2><p>WASD move · Mouse look · Right mouse aim · Left mouse fire · R reload · Shift sprint · Space hop · Q raccoon · Esc release mouse. Touch controls are available in the local prototype.</p></div></section></Base>
